      "answer": "Time to Revenue helps growing service businesses find and remove the operational friction that costs them time, capacity, or revenue \u2014 then designs and builds the revenue, data, and operations systems that fix it.\n\nThat is the canonical client-facing sentence.\n\nMy slight website-ready tightening would be:\n\nTime to Revenue helps growing service businesses remove the operational friction costing them time, capacity, and revenue \u2014 then builds the systems that keep the work moving.\n\nI\u2019d use the second in public copy; keep the first as the canonical internal positioning.",
      "honesty": true,
